{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom is Divided</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet unrest has left Myridor on the brink of divide. A movement to topple the king is set into motion with the kidnapping of his three children - and only you can fight to bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Forces</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy forces, build an army, and lead your faction alongside Luc and Alaric through turn-based tactical combat. The closer you grow to your companions, the greater your strength becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy close moments with the companions within your faction. With branching dialogue choices and an affection point system, you can choose who to keep closest to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Journey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With themes of mental health, power, and survival in mind, traverse Myridor's darkest days - and witness the narrative-focused journey come to light.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809160?t=1761145433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/04e44580b476eca50e8102c4c58f2f2938e884f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761145433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761145433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761145433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":